	"Description": "This is my first mod, a simple custom map with a bit of story behind it, accessible via the [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/8000]Central Station[/url] bus network!. Dunleigh Farm is a foragable area (not a farm replacer) that offers a smaller, cozy layout with:\n<br />\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]A tillable field sized for [b]2 Iridium Sprinklers[/b]\n<br />[*]Forageables and ore spawns on the map\n<br />[*]A small pond with [b]all-season fish[/b]\n<br />[*]Several interactables that add a touch of lo\n<br />[/list]\n<br />[list]\n<br />[/list]Any feedback, thoughts, praise, or endorsements are very much appreciated!",
